{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/s1_sub_005.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/s1_sub_005.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_01",
      "hash64": "89A243AD938D9F89",
      "text": "哦～呵呵呵呵！\\n哦～呵呵呵呵！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_02",
      "hash64": "89A240AD938D9A70",
      "text": "還真是個寒酸到\\n毫無看頭的地方，呵！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_man_01",
      "hash64": "4B73FD52D1B10A3B",
      "text": "我所渴望的就是這種地方！\\n毅萬，謝謝你，呵！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_man_02",
      "hash64": "4B73FE52D1B10BEE",
      "text": "太好了！\\n馥好的幸福，就是我的幸福！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_03",
      "hash64": "89A241AD938D9C23",
      "text": "先把這片土地買下來，\\n然後在這裡做點事業似乎也不錯，呵。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_04",
      "hash64": "89A246AD938DA4A2",
      "text": "哎呀……？\\n又是那位庶民！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_man_03",
      "hash64": "4B73FF52D1B10DA1",
      "text": "真的耶～\\n那肯定就是那位庶民！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_man_04",
      "hash64": "4B740052D1B10F54",
      "text": "馥好的領袖魅力不論何時\\n都會吸引人們過來！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_05",
      "hash64": "89A247AD938DA655",
      "text": "哦～呵呵呵呵！\\n我懂！我懂！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_06",
      "hash64": "89A244AD938DA13C",
      "text": "為老百姓們帶來夢想，\\n正是我們名流的職責……[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_07",
      "hash64": "89A245AD938DA2EF",
      "text": "也就是說，\\n這個東西就送給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了，呵。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_08",
      "hash64": "89A24AAD938DAB6E",
      "text": "庶民啊，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳聽好了。\\n所謂的錢，就藏在鳥不生蛋的地方。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_09",
      "hash64": "89A24BAD938DAD21",
      "text": "無論何時，\\n可能性都是一片藍海，呵……[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_man_05",
      "hash64": "4B740152D1B11107",
      "text": "欸！？太震撼了！\\n字字都是沁入五臟六腑的金言！\\r\\n就像做完瑜珈之後喝的溫開水一樣……！！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_woman_10",
      "hash64": "89A5C8AD9390B75F",
      "text": "好了，毅萬！\\n我想在北上鄉\\r\\n品嚐一下[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]水果[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]，呵！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_man_06",
      "hash64": "4B740252D1B112BA",
      "text": "喲～！\\n又要去沒多久前剛去過的地方！\\r\\n馥好妳真是名流的典範！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_man_07",
      "hash64": "4B740352D1B1146D",
      "text": "我會親手榨很多\\n蘋果汁給妳喝的！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_005_secretary_01",
      "hash64": "B1E81E19EE3B0B01",
      "text": "馥好小姐和毅萬先生\\n前往南第５區和南第１區的\\r\\n邊界一帶了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
